{"words": [{"text": "مَثَلُ", "translation": "Example"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(of) what"}, {"text": "يُنفِقُونَ", "translation": "they spend"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "هَـٰذِهِ", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "translation": "[the] life"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "(of) the world"}, {"text": "كَمَثَلِ", "translation": "(is) like (the) example"}, {"text": "رِيحٍۢ", "translation": "(of) a wind"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "صِرٌّ", "translation": "(is) frost"}, {"text": "أَصَابَتْ", "translation": "it struck"}, {"text": "حَرْثَ", "translation": "(the) harvest"}, {"text": "قَوْمٍۢ", "translation": "(of) a people"}, {"text": "ظَلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "who wronged"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "فَأَهْلَكَتْهُ ۚ", "translation": "then destroyed it"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "ظَلَمَهُمُ", "translation": "(has) wronged them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنْ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَهُمْ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "يَظْلِمُونَ", "translation": "they wronged"}], "sahih": "The example of what they spend in this worldly life is like that of a wind containing frost which strikes the harvest of a people who have wronged themselves [i.e., sinned] and destroys it. And Allāh has not wronged them, but they wrong themselves."}